title: Diary
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /diary/
---
{% from "partials/ride-card.njk" import rideCard %}

<h1>Diary</h1>

<div class="notice-box">
  <ul>
    <li>Rides may be altered at short notice due to unforeseen circumstances or adverse weather forecasts. Please check this page or the WhatsApp group a day or so before the ride.</li>
    <li>On the ride itself, the leader may change the route and/or destination if they deem it necessary.</li>
    <li><strong>Participation in our rides is at your own risk, and subject to you abiding by the club's <a href="{{ '/conduct/' | url }}">Code of Conduct</a>.</strong></li>
    <li>Under 18s should be accompanied by a responsible adult, who is responsible for deciding if a ride is suitable and providing appropriate supervision. To discuss a specific ride, contact the ride leader or <a href="mailto:webmaster@edmontoncycleclub.org">webmaster@edmontoncycleclub.org</a>.</li>
    <li>Guidance from Cycling UK can be found <a href="https://www.cyclinguk.org/advice" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p class="diary-callout">
  Ride leaders and organisers of other events: please send details to
  <a href="mailto:webmaster@edmontoncycleclub.org">webmaster@edmontoncycleclub.org</a> in good time — meeting time
  and place, destination, approximate distance and any special notes.
</p>
<p class="diary-callout diary-callout--emphasis">
  Ride times below are when we actually leave. Please arrive at least five minutes early for any ride briefing,
  earlier still if you want to chat or grab a coffee first.
</p>

{% set upcomingConfirmed = collections.diaryMonth | flattenRides | published | upcoming | sortByDate %}

<section class="diary-section">
  <h2>Upcoming rides and events</h2>
  <div class="ride-list">
    {% for ride in upcomingConfirmed %}{{ rideCard(ride) }}{% endfor %}
    {% if site.showDrafts %}
      {% for ride in collections.diaryMonth | flattenRides | draftsOnly | upcoming | sortByDate %}{{ rideCard(ride) }}{% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% if not upcomingConfirmed.length %}
    <p class="diary-empty">No rides currently scheduled — check back soon.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="diary-section">
  <h2>Past rides and events</h2>
  {% for month in collections.diaryMonth %}
    {% set pastRides = month.data.rides | published | past %}
    {% if pastRides.length %}
      <div class="diary-month">
        <h3>{{ month.data.month | formatMonth }}</h3>
        <div class="ride-list">
          {% for ride in pastRides %}{{ rideCard(ride) }}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
